-bound, a strict saddle on the sphere-shaped Stiefel manifold, the continuum of
-minimizers produced by a repeated eigenvalue, and complex finite-basis PC-VAR
-optimization on the Grassmann quotient. The PC-VAR example declares its later
-model and energy-gradient items as forward references because the supplier page
-is scheduled after this page; its local complex geometry and trust-region
-argument are fully proved here.
